        "## **5. Data Preparation**\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5tWucSn3G3QQ"
      },
      "source": [
        "This section focuses on transforming the raw sales dataset into an analysis-ready format.\n",
        "\n",
        "The preparation process includes:\n",
        "\n",
        "- standardizing column names;\n",
        "- converting date and time fields into appropriate formats;\n",
        "- creating additional temporal features;\n",
        "- standardizing financial metrics into Ukrainian Hryvnia (UAH);\n",
        "- calculating profitability indicators.\n",
        "\n",
        "These transformations enable consistent trend, seasonality and operational analysis throughout the project."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "E6U6nm-5HQY1"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Column Standardization**\n",
        "\n",
        "Column names were standardized to snake_case format to improve readability and ensure consistency throughout the analysis."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 21,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "I7TCeIxZDtBF"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Column standardization\n",
        "\n",
        "sales.columns = (\n",
        "    sales.columns\n",
        "    .str.strip()\n",
        "    .str.lower()\n",
        "    .str.replace(\" \", \"_\")\n",
        "    .str.replace(\".\", \"\")\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "sales = sales.rename(columns={\n",
        "    \"orderid\": \"order_id\",\n",
        "    \"dayofweek\": \"day_of_week\",\n",
        "    \"ordertype\": \"order_type\"\n",
        "})"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "bT1Jg-2GHZPh"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Datetime Conversion**\n",
        "\n",
        "Date and time variables were converted into appropriate datetime formats to support time-based analysis."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 22,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "RkGr754Z9UrQ"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Datetime conversion and time features\n",
        "\n",
        "sales[\"date\"] = pd.to_datetime(sales[\"date\"], dayfirst=True)\n",
        "sales[\"hour\"] = pd.to_datetime(sales[\"time\"], format=\"%H:%M\").dt.hour\n",
        "\n",
        "sales[\"year\"] = sales[\"date\"].dt.year\n",
        "sales[\"month\"] = sales[\"date\"].dt.month\n",
        "sales[\"quarter\"] = sales[\"date\"].dt.quarter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ONJ5_L8EHf3y"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Currency Standardization**\n",
        "\n",
        "To support future benchmarking against the Lviv restaurant marketplace, financial metrics were converted from GBP to UAH.\n",
        "\n",
        "A fixed exchange rate of 59.6544 UAH per GBP was applied based on the official exchange rate published by the National Bank of Ukraine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 23,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YZNCjAib-HM_"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Currency conversion\n",
        "\n",
        "GBP_TO_UAH = 59.6544\n",
        "\n",
        "sales[\"gross_sales_uah\"] = sales[\"gross_sales\"] * GBP_TO_UAH\n",
        "sales[\"est_cost_uah\"] = sales[\"est_cost\"] * GBP_TO_UAH\n",
        "sales[\"est_profit_uah\"] = sales[\"est_profit\"] * GBP_TO_UAH"
      ]
    },
